[p193] Notifications must link users back to the relevant Pricing Initiative and proposal context.
[p193] 
[p193]

[p193]      8.33.      FLOW-033 Workflow Audit History
[p193] 
[p193] 
[p193] Every consequential workflow event must be preserved in chronological history.
[p193] 
[p193] This includes:
[p193] 
[p193]     ● submission;
[p193] 
[p194]    ● routing;
[p194]    ● review completion;
[p194]    ● approval;
[p194]    ● rejection;
[p194]    ● changes requested;
[p194]    ● escalation;
[p194]    ● delegation;
[p194]    ● expiration;
[p194]    ● re-submission;
[p194]    ● policy authorisation;
[p194]    ● execution readiness.

